{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "57bca1d0a87a5395fae83ea46300d46e15916506ea180bd59a4f7c8b41a998a5", "ja": "（『ジャングル☆パーティー』の地方公演は、\n大盛況の内に終わった。あとは劇場に帰るだけだ……）", "zh": "（『丛林☆派对』的地方公演在一片盛况中结束了。\n接下来只剩回剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "4711ccf7437f5b0a71fbb8b1bc7ab0e7505c56748d01203d2ad47ea039ac9460", "ja": "おやぶん！\n地方公演、たまき、すっごくたのしかったぞ～！", "zh": "老大！\n这场地方公演，环表演得很开心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "e1b542645dd492cb41caf0cb46255a9a49a232b05ad1c9caea23aee3f9070bfb", "ja": "おとなの人も小さい子も、\nみーんなでウンババしてくれたね！", "zh": "不管大人还是小朋友，\n大家都跟着「嗯吧吧」了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1003_p", "source_sha256": "46fde1c29d87997bae5e966b3f3b23fb7576668410e4e334129a888100634aa8", "ja": "ああ。色んなお客さんが\n盛り上がってくれて、新鮮だったな！", "zh": "是啊。\n各式各样的观众一同炒热气氛，感觉很新鲜呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "fb77cb0cca8608b11fde81bad978cc6a3c6882a6fcce36d13bd8bd816c8e28c3", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん。たまきたち、\nもう帰らなきゃなんでしょ？", "zh": "欸欸，老大。\n环我们是不是该回去了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1005_p", "source_sha256": "31097371fcf95ce2b432ee725a2f8a4f824413ac5f78f15c76995a69b588374c", "ja": "そうだな、今日中に劇場に戻らないと……。\n環、何かあるのか？", "zh": "是啊，必须在今天之内回到剧场……\n环，你还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "e3ac8d49b26f64dde1f67541c3e1072d6dbf367ade9038b10e0208e4a19382d6", "ja": "うん！　あのね、せっかく遠くまで来たから、\nたまき、みんなにお土産もって帰りたい！", "zh": "嗯！那个啊，难得到这么远的地方来，\n环想要带伴手礼回去给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b91a48e043f99cf936f96fb3772f100de0096d2017564b80c0b67ac71d7f4014", "ja": "みんなにお土産か。よし、せっかくだから\n一緒に選んで買っていこうか。", "zh": "带伴手礼给大家啊。好，既然都来了，\n我们一起买点什么回去送大家吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "038899eddc6b0651a09248b9eb76fa0f7852a4ee73eeef2b16e4c7278f0a715f", "ja": "違うよ、おやぶん。\n買うんじゃなくて、探すんだよ。", "zh": "不是啦，老大。\n不是买，要用找的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7e50a4e356ab0c4437bcd7d89a60e811060a589068272452f06a871f351d4e18", "ja": "え？　……でも、お土産だよな？", "zh": "咦……？但你不是说伴手礼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "88ef532f0ca3ae7fb162f9086a16cad6d5a72a476539ae6b009c07bd27a81e4e", "ja": "うん！\nたまき、いい場所見つけたんだ～。", "zh": "嗯！\n环找到了一个好地方喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "a0a1a74c6c1dc69cdc49cdb7c273a0f52f0c8398280a96096d474a74bee557cd", "ja": "来る途中に、大きな公園があったでしょ？\nあそこなら、いっぱいあると思う！", "zh": "来这里的路上，不是有一个很大的公园吗？\n那里应该找得到很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1542f24a4d7b5d890e1fac8659558018f9403b4d353cf91b6c6bb30527640b4e", "ja": "公園……そういえばあった気がするな。\n森とか小川もあった気がするけど、もしかして……。", "zh": "公园……这么说来好像有印象。\n记得里头还有森林跟小河，该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "a5444a8c4b2d5dd436932ffcb27646c82174ca8c5a6289c7e37cac611f45e088", "ja": "たまき、あそこでお土産探したい！\nめずらしいもの、きっといっぱいあるぞ～。くふふ！", "zh": "环想要在那里找伴手礼！\n一定找得到好多稀奇的东西喔～呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "797b69dad65a784d1544dd1d7e28e646e92bf4f02ae0d89885190ab4dc312569", "ja": "みんなでしょ、社長と、ことりと、みさきと……\nあとはね、劇場の分も！", "zh": "要送给大家、社长、小鸟跟美咲……\n也要送剧场一份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3d1e0812eefa957198a6e53bdd7eb8957ed9d6cbcb4b2aad5f55ecc769eec7e7", "ja": "劇場の分？", "zh": "送剧场一份？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "9f3ecebcafabd2ab471249b8ad2264b84b910265b4e7d8b6b1b1cffa0ea85058", "ja": "うん！　たまきとまみ、出かけてるから。\nお土産あげて、ただいまって言うんだ！", "zh": "嗯！因为环跟真美从剧场出门了嘛。\n所以要给剧场伴手礼，跟它说我回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "260b2041c9fd99eb4121f6116dd1ee6afdfe4a50870881f7613790bccd882b8e", "ja": "そうか……、そうだな。\nそれもいいかもしれない。", "zh": "原来如此……说得也是。\n这样或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "fcbd10d9eca55c5a804eb4516882bdff6ee1050cf0695a5b9255094aea2206f7", "ja": "なにがとれるかな～？\n変な虫、いるかな？", "zh": "在公园可以找到什么呢～？\n会不会有奇怪的虫子啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dad08d1056507cc06ee966b526d9c63b2ea172f0586ee356b08d9abc41bf69b3", "ja": "虫は……生き物だし、やめておいた方がいいな！\n木の実とか、葉っぱはどうだ？", "zh": "昆虫……毕竟是活的，不要抓比较好！\n树果或叶子之类的怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0083_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "72d8bea08c56a094f5c8b22de94d75dedffb916cd62767585efd77d657ece6d3", "ja": "わかった！\nみんながよろこぶの、今から楽しみだぞ～。くふふ♪", "zh": "好！\n我已经开始期待大家开心的样子了喔～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
